const seo = `<h1>søren *live — bio</h1>
<p>søren is a live electronic project defined by the tension between improvisational fluidity and studio-grade precision. originally formed in 2017 by producers göran and sven, the project was born from an early commitment to hardware-only performance, making its mark on stages like südpol, moloch, and habitat festival.</p>
<p>following a hiatus dedicated to individual growth — göran refining his minimalist output as co-founder of the bladehouse imprint, and sven delving into the complexities of sound design and algorithmic programming — the duo has returned with a reconfigured approach.</p>
<p>the current iteration of søren moves away from rigid dogma; the computer has returned to the setup, serving alongside an extensive hardware array. a floor-focused sound that prioritizes depth and melodic clarity.</p>`;
